# Guide / training text PDFs

Companion inventory + quality bar: [`docs/audit/guide-pdf-quality-2026-08.md`](../../docs/audit/guide-pdf-quality-2026-08.md).  
Layout engine spec: [`docs/modules/GUIDE_PDF_LAYOUT.md`](../../docs/modules/GUIDE_PDF_LAYOUT.md).

## Hard rules

1. **Shared chrome only** — pocket sheets, floor checklists, bylaws sheets, steward workspace PDFs, and certificates draw through [`text-pdf-layout.ts`](../../src/lib/export/text-pdf-layout.ts) (layout primitives in [`pdf-layout/`](../../src/lib/export/pdf-layout/)). Do not reintroduce private jsPDF letter loops.
2. **Header contract** — logo → **title** → accent rule → subtitle/instructions. Never draw the rule before the title.
3. **Footer band contract** (worksheets with tips) — tips heading → bullets → reminder → disclaimer. Always top-down via `renderGuideFooterBand`; never bottom-up.
4. **Mark + field engine** — all writers call `drawGuidePlatformMark()`; `field`/`fieldPair`/`checkPair` wrap via `worksheet-fields.ts` (render + measure share constants).
5. **Layout modes** — `flow` | `pinnedFooter` | `pinnedClosing`. Set `layoutMode` explicitly on dense templates; run `layoutWorksheet()` in tests for one-page handouts.
6. **Platform awareness** — header embeds UnionOps mark PNG. Education footer wordmark required.
7. **Dynamic-import jsPDF** (`TOOL-004`). Wrap UI triggers in `useExportHandler`.
8. **EN + FR** copy parity on claim (`i18n-public-copy.mdc`).
9. **Canvas Comms PDFs** stay on `pdf-export.ts` — not text-PDF layout.
10. **One `fill` block per worksheet** — always set `maxRows`. Prefer fixed `count` for floor handouts.

## Tests

- Unit: `pdf-layout.test.ts`, `text-pdf-layout.test.ts`, `land-acknowledgement-worksheet-pdf.test.ts`, `guide-pdf-contract.test.ts`
- Spatial: `expectBlockOrder`, `expectFooterBandOrder` in `worksheet-pdf-test-helpers.ts`
- Smoke: `e2e/guide-pdf.export.smoke.spec.ts`
- Preview: `npm run pdf:preview -- land-acknowledgement en`

## When adding a new guide handout PDF

1. Add export to inventory in the audit doc.
2. Pick writer: checklist → `writeBrandedChecklistPdf`; worksheet → `writeBrandedWorksheetPdf` + optional `buildWorksheet()` DSL; notes → `writeBrandedNotesPdf`.
3. Choose layout mode; validate with `layoutWorksheet()` before shipping one-page handouts.
4. Extend `guide-pdf-contract.test.ts` or `pdf-layout.test.ts` golden spatial contracts.
5. Steward-visible capability → What's new note (`whats-new.mdc`).
